; Script code $9E: start the animated tiles of the bottom row
;
; No operands. Writes 0 (NOP) over the RET at #R$AE20, so that routine runs from the main loop on every frame; it
; swaps the tiles $3B and $3C in the bottom row of the tile map (row 21) every second pass and marks those cells for
; redraw. Observed: $AE20 holds 0 in room 22 and $C9 in the other rooms tried (5, 16, 19, 25), so the room entry puts
; the RET back. Used by rooms 21, 22 and 23 ($80FB, $81C1, $8263).
@label=OpAnimateFloor
c$A1B9 XOR A         ;
 $A1BA LD ($AE20),A  ; NOP over the RET at $AE20
 $A1BD RET           ;
